Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.18.28-rt28 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.18.28 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.18-rt
  Head SHA1: 700b7080eb2e8a941a3b03f3b4f1d19142a97cfd


Or to build 3.18.28-rt28 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.18.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.18.28.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.18/patch-3.18.28-rt28.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

